# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL FINANCIAL DATA — never commit. This repo is PUBLIC.
# Sportsbook exports and the local warehouse contain a complete record of
# personal betting activity. Git history is permanent and forks cannot be
# recalled: a single accidental commit is an irreversible disclosure.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
exports/
samples/
